  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EGNOS in Africa - Support to the JPO Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective is to improve flight safety in Africa. The specific objective is to improve flight safety at lesser cost in Africa through the adoption of a long-term strategy based on use of Satellite-Based Augmentation System Technology. The outputs of the action are: the JPO is operational and delivers coordinated support to African modules regarding the adoption of EGNOS in Africa; and studies for the development phase of EGNOS version III in Africa carried out and specific needs identified.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
